# Meta AI Suite: Meta AI, Model API, Llama, Muse and Muse Code
# Place before Meta / Facebook / Instagram and other AI rules
# Shared login hosts below also serve non-AI Meta products
# Shared Facebook / Instagram APIs and CDNs are covered by Meta.list
# Updated: 2026-10-16
# Research and limitations: ../../../docs/Meta.md (repository root)

# > Meta AI web / App, Model API, Muse Code API / launcher and developer console
# https://ai.meta.com/meta-ai/
# https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview (api.meta.ai / dev.meta.ai)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ai.meta.com

# > Llama
# https://www.llama.com/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,llama.com

# > Muse
# https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/introducing-muse-personal-ai-agent/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai

# > Muse VM infrastructure (official public web bundle and community evidence)
# Public Muse bundle parses VM hostnames under .metaaivm.com
# https://github.com/xingyingyuzhui/Rules/blob/main/docs/Meta-2026-10-16.md
# https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community/blob/c6adacf29cc4fb05e04651fcf03e00989ef9f797/data/meta
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com

# > Muse privacy transport (exact hosts from the official public web bundle)
# Shared Meta privacy endpoints may also carry non-AI traffic
# See docs/Meta-2026-10-16.md for source URLs, hashes and validation limits
DOMAIN,meta-ohttp-config-prod.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,meta-ohttp-relay-prod.fastly-edge.com

# > AI Studio legacy entry point
# https://about.fb.com/news/2024/07/create-your-own-custom-ai-with-ai-studio/
# New character creation/editing ended on 2026-08-10; existing chats remain
DOMAIN,aistudio.instagram.com

# > Shared Meta account sign-in / Accounts Center
# https://auth.meta.com/login
# https://accountscenter.meta.com/ (redirects to auth.meta.com)
DOMAIN,auth.meta.com
DOMAIN,accountscenter.meta.com
